### 주문 접수 (A11) - 응답의 id 를 아래 {id} 자리에 쓴다
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"buyer@example.com","address":"서울시 실습로 10 101호","postcode":"01234","items":[{"menuId":1,"quantity":2},{"menuId":2,"quantity":1}]}

### 이메일별 주문 목록 (A12)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?email=buyer@example.com

### 주문 상세 (A13)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1

### 주문 메모 수정 (A22)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1/memo
Content-Type: application/json

{"memo":"문 앞에 놓아주세요"}

### 재주문 (A23)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1/reorder

### 배송지 불일치 (409) - 같은 이메일, 같은 배송일, 다른 주소
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"buyer@example.com","address":"부산시 다른길 99","postcode":"01234","items":[{"menuId":1,"quantity":1}]}

### 이메일 형식 오류 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"not-an-email","address":"서울시 실습로 10 101호","postcode":"01234","items":[{"menuId":1,"quantity":1}]}

### 수량 오류 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"buyer@example.com","address":"서울시 실습로 10 101호","postcode":"01234","items":[{"menuId":1,"quantity":21}]}

### 없는 주문 조회 (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/999999

### 주문 취소 (A16)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1/cancel

### 이미 취소된 주문 재취소 (200)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1/cancel